t's necessary but not particularly exciting from an R&D perspective, and the execution approach could be more efficient.\n\nI'll approve it with a moderate promise score - maybe 62-68. It's needed, bounded, but not leveraging existing infrastructure optimally as described, and it's purely reactive compliance work.\n\nLet me settle on: approve, promise 65.\n",
